# ZEsarUX adapter prerequisite

ZRCP is unauthenticated. Before using `tools/rock-emu` with a ZEsarUX source
checkout, apply `0001-zrcp-loopback-bind.patch` from that checkout with
`patch -p1 < /path/to/0001-zrcp-loopback-bind.patch`, then rebuild ZEsarUX.

The patch adds `--remoteprotocol-host`, defaulting to `127.0.0.1`. The launcher
refuses ZEsarUX binaries that do not expose this option.
